        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPT-217, Retro 2\" Triangle Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small Triangular Ring Pull is for use on small doors and drawers such as cabinets, on furniture, and sliding closet doors. It features a very easy screw-on installation. The triangle shape has a retro feel that is just lovely. The unusualness of the shape will surely be an attention catcher. Available in 5 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-inch-triangular-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpt-322\">Large Triangular Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Triangular RPT217 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip: 3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
